<title>SWITZERLAND: Zurich Nov inflation falls to 0.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Zurich Nov inflation falls to 0.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consumer prices in Zurich, Switzerland's biggest city, fell 0.1 percent in November from October for a year-on-year inflation rate of 0.7 percent, the city statistics office said.</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996	Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index change   -0.1 pct	+0.2 pct	+0.1 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr inflation		+0.7 pct	+0.9 pct	+1.9 pct</p>
<p> Index (May 1993 = 100)	  102.9	   103.0	   102.2</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
